patches/finetune-spark.patch and patches/vanillux2-docker-timeout.patch are
modifications to files from hamishivi/tmax (https://github.com/hamishivi/tmax),
a fork of allenai/open-instruct, Copyright AllenAI, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. They apply to tmax commit 6d3d606c.

spark_opt.py replaces one function of Liger Kernel
(https://github.com/linkedin/Liger-Kernel, BSD 2-Clause) at run time and calls
its cross-entropy kernel unchanged. No Liger Kernel source is copied here.

patches/tmax-harness-config/ holds the system prompt and tool schema that the
tmax SFT trajectories were generated with, reconstructed from the released data.
